# FE Testing Rule

Always follow `docs/TESTING_STRATEGY.md`.

## Official stack

- Vitest
- React Testing Library
- MSW
- Playwright

## Minimum required coverage

- Axios refresh and retry flow
- auth/session transitions
- websocket cache patch and reconciliation
- reconnect and refetch recovery
- countdown and server-time offset logic
- seller auction form validation
- media uploader state machine

## Rules

- Mock network boundaries, not internal implementation details, when testing feature integration.
- Verify REST reconciliation even when realtime is involved.
- Do not add untested auth or bidding logic changes.
